1
00:00:08,852 --> 00:00:13,858
Customers screen par aapke saare customers hain,
unke bakaaya ke saath.

2
00:00:13,898 --> 00:00:16,630
Upar naam ya mobile se khoj sakte hain.

3
00:00:17,409 --> 00:00:21,360
Naya customer jodne ke liye 'Add customer'
dabaaiye.

4
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,427
Naam, mobile, aur business customer ho to uska
GSTIN.

5
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:31,106
Credit limit tay karti hai ki customer adhiktam
kitna udhaar le sakta hai.

6
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:36,690
WhatsApp par offers bhejne se pehle customer ki
anumati zaroori hai.

7
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:39,991
Customer haan kahe, tabhi yeh box tick kijiye.

8
00:00:40,031 --> 00:00:44,943
Yeh consent record mein rehta hai aur kabhi bhi
hataaya ja sakta hai.

9
00:00:45,684 --> 00:00:50,955
Jin customers par udhaar baaki hai, unke aage
bakaaya rakam dikhti hai.

10
00:00:50,995 --> 00:00:54,695
Receive se payment lijiye, cash, UPI ya card
mein.

11
00:00:54,735 --> 00:00:57,987
Remind se WhatsApp par yaad dila sakte hain,

12
00:00:58,027 --> 00:01:02,101
aur Pay link se online payment ka link bhej
sakte hain.

13
00:01:02,861 --> 00:01:08,006
Rakesh ji ne apne udhaar mein se paanch sau
rupaye UPI se jama kiye.

14
00:01:08,046 --> 00:01:12,353
Receive dabaakar amount aur mode chuniye aur
save kijiye.

15
00:01:12,393 --> 00:01:15,022
Unka bakaaya turant ghat jaata hai.

16
00:01:15,779 --> 00:01:19,227
Dhyan dein: is device counter par poora customer
ledger

17
00:01:19,267 --> 00:01:24,808
aur statement alag screen par nahi hai; bakaaya
aur payments yahin Customers screen par,

18
00:01:24,848 --> 00:01:29,501
aur har bill Bills screen par customer ke naam
ya mobile se mil jaata hai.
